// notation tex: every formula reads as LaTeX, even one with no command in it
notation tex

In LaTeX $a_{ij}$ is a subscript, $ABCD$ is four letters, $xy$ a product, and
$\left( a_{ij} \right)$ the same; $x^{-1/2}$ has an exponent of $-1/2$, and
$1/\log x$ divides by a logarithm.

    \sum_{k=1}^{n} k = \frac{n(n+1)}{2}.
